  "body": "Waterfront Living with Breath Taking Views\r\n\r\nEnjoy an enviable Mission Bay lifestyle in this beautifully positioned ground-floor apartment, designed by renowned architect Bob Donald. Offering an exceptional combination of location, sunshine, and spectacular outlooks, this is a property that is sure to impress.\r\n\r\nThe apartment features two generous bedrooms, excellent bathroom and two toilets, and a designer kitchen, complemented by impressive floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the interior with natural light.\r\nStep outside onto your private, sun-drenched, north-facing deck - the perfect place to relax, entertain, or simply enjoy the beautiful views across Auckland Harbour, with Mission Bay Beach, the picturesque park, and its iconic fountain creating a stunning backdrop to everyday living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* Prime Mission Bay waterfront position\r\n* Robert Donald Architecture\r\n* Generous bedrooms\r\n* Excellent bathrooms\r\n* Stylish designer kitchen\r\n* Floor-to-ceiling windows maximising light and views\r\n* Private, sunny north-facing deck\r\n* Tandem garage providing secure parking\r\n* Spectacular Auckland Harbour, park, and fountain views\r\n\r\nLocation, Lifestyle and Convenience\r\n\r\nWith Mission Bay Beach, cafés, restaurants, and local shops just a stone's throw away, everything you need is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for an exceptional investment, a lock-up-and-leave waterfront retreat, or the perfect home for retirement, this outstanding apartment offers an enviable lifestyle in one of Auckland's most sought-after seaside locations.\r\n\r\nWaterfront living doesn't get much better than this. \r\nDon't miss this special Mission Bay opportunity!\r\n\r\nOPEN HOME MIDDAY SAT/SUN 12.00-12.30\r\n                                or\r\nCall now - John van Velthooven  021-949-100",
